Awesome Debrid Media licensing

This repository uses different licenses for different categories of material.

Implementation code — MIT

The MIT License applies to implementation/source code, including `scripts/**`,
`.github/**`, and site implementation code/assets, unless a file carries a more
specific license notice.

SPDX license identifier: MIT
Full text: `LICENSES/MIT.txt`

Curated data and repository-authored documentation/content — CC0 1.0 Universal

CC0 1.0 Universal applies to `data/**`, `docs/**`, `README.md`,
`CONTRIBUTING.md`, and other repository-authored explanatory or factual
content, unless a file carries a more specific license notice. Generated
textual comparison content derived from those materials is likewise offered
under CC0-1.0 to the extent the repository contributors hold rights in it.

SPDX license identifier: CC0-1.0
Full text: `LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt`

Third-party material

Project names, trademarks, logos, screenshots, linked pages, quotations, and
other third-party material are not relicensed by this repository merely
because they are referenced, described, or linked here. Their original rights
and license terms continue to apply.

If a file contains an explicit license notice that differs from this overview,
that file-specific notice controls.
